TI  - HaVen: Hallucination-Mitigated LLM for Verilog Code Generation Aligned with HDL Engineers
AU  - Yang, Y.
AU  - Teng, F.
AU  - Liu, P.
AU  - Qi, M.
AU  - Lv, C.
