TI  - Towards automatic extraction of UML class diagrams: Creation of an annotated dataset for training deep models
AU  - Babaalla, Z.
AU  - Jakimi, A.
AU  - Saadane, R.
AU  - Chehri, A.
A2  - Chen Y.-W.
A2  - Howlett R.J.
